1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,801
A small house in Hyderabad. All the happiness in that home...

2
00:00:04,801 --> 00:00:06,890
was their only son, Abhinav.

3
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:09,185
Here, dear... curd and sugar.

4
00:00:09,185 --> 00:00:12,960
It's your first-salary day... go well, and come back.

5
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:17,120
Amma, this Sunday I want to take you both to Srisailam.

6
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:21,040
It was Tatayya's wish... I'll fulfil it with my salary!

7
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:28,400
Ride slowly. Your Tatayya's rudraksha is on your wrist... take care.

8
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:31,680
Okay, Nanna! I'll be back with sweets this evening!

9
00:00:32,170 --> 00:00:36,490
But fate... had something else written for that day.

10
00:00:57,040 --> 00:01:00,800
Oh no! He tried to save that little girl... and he's down!

11
00:01:01,040 --> 00:01:04,723
Hello, 108? There's been an accident near the Ameerpet signal!

12
00:01:04,723 --> 00:01:07,040
The boy is unconscious... come quickly!

13
00:01:07,530 --> 00:01:11,810
Out of pure humanity, he saved a little girl's life...

14
00:01:11,810 --> 00:01:16,170
but now his own life flickered like a lamp in the wind.

15
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:27,240
Hello... is this Abhinav's home? I'm calling from City Hospital.

16
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:31,240
Yes... I'm his mother. What happened?

17
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:35,501
Amma, I'm sorry... your son has had an accident.

18
00:01:35,501 --> 00:01:38,600
It's serious. Please come right away.

19
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:41,240
Listen...! Our Abhi...!

20
00:01:41,730 --> 00:01:47,490
O Lord... nothing must happen to my child... nothing, Swami...

21
00:01:47,720 --> 00:01:53,480
He has a severe head injury, with internal bleeding. We must operate right away.

22
00:01:53,720 --> 00:01:57,240
Doctor... how is my son?

23
00:01:57,480 --> 00:02:02,680
We'll do everything we can. Please sign here... every minute counts.

24
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:06,600
Please save my son somehow, Doctor!

25
00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:18,240
Shivayya... take my life if you must... but save my child, Father...

26
00:02:18,480 --> 00:02:24,080
He hasn't even seen life yet, Swami... if you must take someone, take me.

27
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:26,840
I fed him curd and sent him off this morning...

28
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:29,520
he said he'd come back with sweets this evening...

29
00:02:35,090 --> 00:02:38,290
Doctor! BP is falling... I can't find a pulse!

30
00:02:38,790 --> 00:02:41,190
Get the defibrillator ready... quickly!

31
00:02:46,770 --> 00:02:51,170
In that fear... Raghava remembered his father's words.

32
00:02:51,440 --> 00:02:57,097
Raghava... on the day no medicine works, the day death stands at the door...

33
00:02:57,097 --> 00:03:03,200
chant the Mahamrityunjaya mantra. Chant it with faith... and even Yama steps back.

34
00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:07,440
(He chants the Mahamrityunjaya Mantra, three cycles)

35
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:41,080
Abhinav... your time is over. Come.

36
00:03:41,320 --> 00:03:44,520
Lord Yama awaits you.

37
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:49,320
No... my mother, my father... they can't live without me!

38
00:03:54,640 --> 00:04:01,920
Stop! This soul's time has not yet come. His work on earth is not yet done.

39
00:04:02,410 --> 00:04:04,410
As you command, Mahadeva.

40
00:04:04,890 --> 00:04:07,290
Go, my child... go back.

41
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:16,850
His heart had stopped... but suddenly it started beating again!

42
00:04:16,850 --> 00:04:21,640
In twenty years of practice I've never seen this. It's truly a miracle!

43
00:04:21,880 --> 00:04:24,680
Shivayya... your grace...

44
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:28,120
You heard our plea, Swami!

45
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:43,960
Abhi... my dear! You opened your eyes, my child... my life has come back!

46
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:49,240
I heard you saved that little girl... I'm so proud of you.

47
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:53,320
Amma... Nanna... I went somewhere far away...

48
00:04:53,320 --> 00:04:57,160
but the power of your mantra brought me back.

49
00:04:57,400 --> 00:05:02,566
Abhinav, your journey does not end here. A great task you must fulfil still remains.

50
00:05:02,566 --> 00:05:07,363
A great responsibility that will give your life its true meaning awaits you...

51
00:05:08,130 --> 00:05:13,602
What else did the divine voice tell Abhinav? Who must he save?

52
00:05:13,602 --> 00:05:19,250
To find out... follow and subscribe to Mantra Shakti for Part 2!

